{"seq":2,"slug":"customs-receipt-status","title":"海关回执与清关状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/customs-receipt-status","wordCount":1769,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"海关回执与清关状态机\">海关回执与清关状态机</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>申报接口返回的「受理」只意味着海关收到了报文，不意味着审批通过。真正的判决通过<strong>回执</strong>异步送达——海关对申报数据做入库、审单、风险布控、放行等一系列处理，每一步都可能产生一条回执。系统必须把这一串异步回执还原成一个可靠的状态机，并且能在回执乱序、重复、丢失的情况下仍然收敛到正确状态。</p>\n<p>这个问题的难点不在于状态本身有多少个，而在于<strong>外部事实的不可靠性</strong>。回执可能因为网络原因丢失，可能被重复推送，可能乱序到达（先收到「放行」再收到「入库」）。如果状态机是「按到达顺序线性推进」，它在真实环境里几乎必然出错。正确做法是让状态机由<strong>回执中携带的绝对状态</strong>驱动，而不是由事件顺序驱动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Draft: 组装完成&#10;  Draft --&gt; Sent: 已发送&#10;  Sent --&gt; Accepted: 海关受理回执&#10;  Sent --&gt; SendUnknown: 超时/无响应&#10;  SendUnknown --&gt; Accepted: 主动查询确认&#10;  SendUnknown --&gt; Draft: 查询确认未收到&#10;  Accepted --&gt; Audited: 审结回执&#10;  Accepted --&gt; Rejected: 退单回执&#10;  Audited --&gt; Released: 放行回执&#10;  Audited --&gt; Inspecting: 查验布控&#10;  Rejected --&gt; Draft: 修正后重报(version+1)&#10;  Inspecting --&gt; Released: 查验通过&#10;  Inspecting --&gt; Held: 扣留&#10;  Released --&gt; [*]&#10;  Held --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Draft: 组装完成\n  Draft --&gt; Sent: 已发送\n  Sent --&gt; Accepted: 海关受理回执\n  Sent --&gt; SendUnknown: 超时/无响应\n  SendUnknown --&gt; Accepted: 主动查询确认\n  SendUnknown --&gt; Draft: 查询确认未收到\n  Accepted --&gt; Audited: 审结回执\n  Accepted --&gt; Rejected: 退单回执\n  Audited --&gt; Released: 放行回执\n  Audited --&gt; Inspecting: 查验布控\n  Rejected --&gt; Draft: 修正后重报(version+1)\n  Inspecting --&gt; Released: 查验通过\n  Inspecting --&gt; Held: 扣留\n  Released --&gt; [*]\n  Held --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"回执的分类与语义\">回执的分类与语义</h2><p>回执按语义可分三类：<strong>过程回执</strong>（受理、入库、审结）表示处理进度，<strong>结果回执</strong>（放行、查验、扣货、退单）表示处理结论，<strong>状态回执</strong>（异常、挂起）表示需要人工介入。三类的处置方式不同——过程回执只更新状态，结果回执要触发业务动作（发货或拦截），状态回执要建工单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回执类型</th>\n<th>典型含义</th>\n<th>是否终态</th>\n<th>业务动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>受理</td>\n<td>报文格式通过，已入库</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>记录，等待后续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入库</td>\n<td>数据已进入海关系统</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审结</td>\n<td>审单完成，无异议</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>准备放行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放行</td>\n<td>允许出区</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>触发发货、记账册</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退单</td>\n<td>数据不合规，退回</td>\n<td>是（该版本）</td>\n<td>修正后重报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查验</td>\n<td>需实货查验</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>暂停发货，建查验工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扣留</td>\n<td>货物被扣</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>建处置工单，通知用户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"退单的原因分类\">退单的原因分类</h3><p>退单不是笼统的失败，它的 <code>reason_code</code> 决定了修复路径。工程上应把退单原因分类成「可自动修复」与「需人工」两档：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因类别</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>修复方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式错误</td>\n<td>字段缺失、格式不合法</td>\n<td>修正报文自动重报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据不一致</td>\n<td>三单对不上</td>\n<td>回退到对碰流程核查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度/清单</td>\n<td>超限值、不在清单</td>\n<td>需用户或业务决策，不能自动重报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体资格</td>\n<td>备案编码无效</td>\n<td>需人工联系海关或更新备案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把「额度/清单」类退单误当作格式错误自动重报，是最浪费精力的错误——重报一万次也不会通过，因为根因在业务数据而非报文格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乱序与重复回执的处理\">乱序与重复回执的处理</h2><h3 id=\"用绝对状态而非事件顺序驱动\">用绝对状态而非事件顺序驱动</h3><p>处理乱序的标准做法是：让回执携带一个<strong>状态序号或状态枚举的偏序关系</strong>，状态机只接受「向前」的跃迁，忽略「向后」的回执。这样即使「放行」先于「入库」到达，状态也会先跃迁到「放行」，随后到达的「入库」因为已处于更后状态而被忽略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[收到回执 R] --&gt; B[查当前状态 S]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;rank R 大于 rank S ?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[跃迁到 R, 触发业务动作]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[忽略: 陈旧回执]&#10;  D --&gt; F[记录回执流水]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[更新 last_receipt_at]\">flowchart TD\n  A[收到回执 R] --&gt; B[查当前状态 S]\n  B --&gt; C{\"rank R 大于 rank S ?\"}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[跃迁到 R, 触发业务动作]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[忽略: 陈旧回执]\n  D --&gt; F[记录回执流水]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[更新 last_receipt_at]</pre><p><code>rank</code> 是状态在偏序中的位置。关键在于<strong>终态不可回退</strong>：一旦进入「放行」或「退单」，任何后续回执都不能改变它（除非是撤销，撤销是独立的一次业务操作而非回执）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重复回执的去重\">重复回执的去重</h3><p>回执去重靠回执本身的唯一标识（海关侧通常提供回执编号或报文流水号）。用唯一约束兜底，与第 2 章三单的去重思路一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE customs_receipt (&#10;  receipt_id     BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  manifest_no    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  decl_version   INTEGER     NOT NULL,&#10;  receipt_no     VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,   -- 海关侧回执编号&#10;  receipt_type   VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- accepted|audited|released|rejected|inspecting|held&#10;  reason_code    VARCHAR(32) NULL,&#10;  reason_msg     TEXT        NULL,&#10;  received_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  raw_digest     BYTEA       NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT uq_receipt UNIQUE (manifest_no, decl_version, receipt_no)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_receipt_manifest ON customs_receipt(manifest_no, decl_version, received_at);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> customs_receipt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  manifest_no    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decl_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_no     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 海关侧回执编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- accepted|audited|released|rejected|inspecting|held</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_msg     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  received_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  raw_digest     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_receipt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (manifest_no, decl_version, receipt_no)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_receipt_manifest</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customs_receipt(manifest_no, decl_version, received_at);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uq_receipt</code> 让重复推送的回执在写入时就被拒绝，业务处理逻辑不必再判断「这条我处理过没有」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回执丢失与主动查询\">回执丢失与主动查询</h3><p>回执可能根本没到达（海关发了但我方没收到）。因此必须有一个<strong>定时对账任务</strong>：扫描所有处于非终态且超过一定时间没有新回执的申报单，主动向海关查询其状态。这种「先查询再决定」的处置思路与分布式系统中处理不确定结果的标准做法一致——对于可能已产生副作用的请求，超时后应通过幂等的查询确认状态，而不是直接重发 (<a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/\">draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header: The Idempotency-Key HTTP Header Field</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant J as 对账任务(定时)&#10;  participant D as 申报库&#10;  participant C as 海关查询接口&#10;  J-&gt;&gt;D: 查非终态且 stale &gt; T 的单&#10;  D--&gt;&gt;J: 候选清单&#10;  loop 每个候选&#10;    J-&gt;&gt;C: 按 manifest_no 查询&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;J: 当前状态&#10;    J-&gt;&gt;D: 补写缺失回执 / 更新状态&#10;  end\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant J as 对账任务(定时)\n  participant D as 申报库\n  participant C as 海关查询接口\n  J-&gt;&gt;D: 查非终态且 stale &gt; T 的单\n  D--&gt;&gt;J: 候选清单\n  loop 每个候选\n    J-&gt;&gt;C: 按 manifest_no 查询\n    C--&gt;&gt;J: 当前状态\n    J-&gt;&gt;D: 补写缺失回执 / 更新状态\n  end</pre><p>超时阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 要按回执类型分别设定：受理类回执通常秒级，审结/放行可能分钟到小时级。统一设一个阈值会导致对慢流程的无效查询，浪费海关接口配额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时与滞箱\">超时与滞箱</h2><p>申报长期停留在非终态会带来实际成本——货在保税仓里占着位置，订单无法发货，用户在等。因此状态机之外还要有一层<strong>业务超时</strong>处理。</p>\n<p>设申报进入 <code>Accepted</code> 后等待审结的时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">status = \\begin{cases} normal &amp; \\Delta t \\le T_1 \\\\ watch &amp; T_1 &lt; \\Delta t \\le T_2 \\\\ escalate &amp; \\Delta t &gt; T_2 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">esc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>进入 <code>watch</code> 时记录告警；进入 <code>escalate</code> 时建人工工单并通知运营，由人决定是否联系海关查询或主动撤单重报。区分这两档的意义是让运营的注意力集中在真正卡住的单上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与库存-用户的联动\">状态机与库存、用户的联动</h2><p>清关状态机的产出不只是「这单现在什么状态」，它还要驱动两个下游：库存账册（放行才允许出区扣减）与用户通知（放行才通知发货，退单要通知重下）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[放行回执] --&gt; B[账册出库记负分录]&#10;  A --&gt; C[订单状态→已放行]&#10;  C --&gt; D[通知用户: 已发货]&#10;  E[退单回执] --&gt; F[订单→待修正]&#10;  F --&gt; G[引导用户重下或退款]&#10;  E --&gt; H[释放额度冻结]&#10;  I[扣留回执] --&gt; J[建处置工单]&#10;  J --&gt; K[通知用户: 延期]\">graph TD\n  A[放行回执] --&gt; B[账册出库记负分录]\n  A --&gt; C[订单状态→已放行]\n  C --&gt; D[通知用户: 已发货]\n  E[退单回执] --&gt; F[订单→待修正]\n  F --&gt; G[引导用户重下或退款]\n  E --&gt; H[释放额度冻结]\n  I[扣留回执] --&gt; J[建处置工单]\n  J --&gt; K[通知用户: 延期]</pre><p>这三条联动必须在回执处理的事务内完成，或至少用可靠的消息机制保证最终一致。若账册扣减成功但用户通知失败，是可恢复的；若账册扣减失败而订单已置为已放行，就是账实不符——因此<strong>账册动作放在联动链的最前面</strong>，它失败则整个回执处理回滚重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>受理不等于通过，真正的判决通过异步回执送达，状态机必须能处理乱序、重复与丢失。</li>\n<li>回执分过程回执、结果回执、状态回执三类，处置方式不同；退单原因要分可自动修复与需人工两档。</li>\n<li>状态机由回执携带的绝对状态驱动而非事件顺序；终态不可回退。</li>\n<li>去重靠回执唯一编号加数据库唯一约束；丢失靠定时对账任务主动查询，超时阈值按回执类型分设。</li>\n<li>业务超时分 watch/escalate 两档，把运营注意力集中到真正卡住的单上。</li>\n<li>回执处理的联动顺序是账册在前、订单与用户在后，保证失败可重试且不产生账实不符。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>放行之外还有查验、扣货等分支需要独立的处置流程，见 <a href=\"release-hold-customs\">放行/查验/扣货处置</a>；放行后触发的账册出库与税款结算，见 <a href=\"../bonded-tax-settlement/bonded-reconcile-audit\">保税库存/税款对账与审计</a>；申报报文的构造与签名，见 <a href=\"manifest-declare-api\">清单申报接口与报文</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海关回执与清关状态机","id":"海关回执与清关状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"回执的分类与语义","id":"回执的分类与语义"},{"level":3,"text":"退单的原因分类","id":"退单的原因分类"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序与重复回执的处理","id":"乱序与重复回执的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"用绝对状态而非事件顺序驱动","id":"用绝对状态而非事件顺序驱动"},{"level":3,"text":"重复回执的去重","id":"重复回执的去重"},{"level":3,"text":"回执丢失与主动查询","id":"回执丢失与主动查询"},{"level":2,"text":"超时与滞箱","id":"超时与滞箱"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与库存、用户的联动","id":"状态机与库存-用户的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"清单申报接口与报文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/manifest-declare-api"},"next":{"title":"放行/查验/扣货处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-import-three-docs-match/customs-declare-receipt/release-hold-customs"}}